avs-cd N/BackflipEndless
IF EXISTS WHDSaves:BackflipEndless/savedata
  copy WHDSaves:BackflipEndless/savedata savedata ALL CLONE QUIET
ENDIF
backflip_endless >NIL:
avs-cd N/BackflipEndless
IF EXISTS savedata
  IF NOT EXISTS WHDSaves:BackflipEndless
    makedir WHDSaves:BackflipEndless
  ENDIF
  copy savedata WHDSaves:BackflipEndless/savedata ALL CLONE QUIET
ENDIF
